  <note role="guidance">
    <title>Guiding references</title>
    <bibliolist>
      <xi:include href="../../../shared/bibliography/fsfe-2024.xml"/>
    </bibliolist>
  </note>
  <simpara>
    The project is REUSE-compliant.
    Licence texts are stored in <filename>LICENSES/</filename> using SPDX filenames.
  </simpara>
  <simpara>
    For project-authored files that can carry headers:
  </simpara>
  <itemizedlist>
    <listitem>
      <simpara>
        Set the SPDX <code>License-Identifier</code> to <literal>GPL-3.0-or-later</literal>.
      </simpara>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
      <simpara>
        Use <code>FileCopyrightText</code> to credit Chrysalide Learning and the author.
      </simpara>
    </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
  <simpara>
    Preserve upstream copyright notices in third-party files.
    Use <filename>REUSE.toml</filename> for files that cannot carry headers, such as binaries or Markdown, or for upstream notices that are not REUSE-compliant.
  </simpara>
